id: pm-rust-otel
title: Pinned CLI installation fails on unavailable telemetry dependency versions
description: "CI run 37472610207 at 31875f2: all three Rust jobs and all three release aggregates fail during npm install -g @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.10.5. npm ETARGET reports no matching @opentelemetry/resources@2.12.0 or @opentelemetry/sdk-trace@2.12.0. The preceding CI run 37469869069 installed the same oracle successfully. Investigate upstream dependency resolution separately from Windows coverage fixtures."
type: Issue
status: canceled
priority: 1
tags[2]: ci,dependencies
created_at: "2026-10-06T13:44:36.578Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-07T01:23:01.602Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-07T00:24:50.319Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-07T00:24:50.319Z"
author: codex-sol
acceptance_criteria: A fresh install of the pinned oracle succeeds on all three CI platforms; preserve the 2026.10.5 conformance target and all existing release thresholds
parent: pm-rust-u4al
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-06T13:46:43.768Z",claude-orchestrator,"Root cause: upstream OpenTelemetry 2.12.0 release was mid-propagation (resources@2.12.0 published 13:40:53Z, CI install failed 13:40:43Z; sdk-trace-2.12.0.tgz still 404 at 13:45Z). @unbrained/pm-cli ships no npm-shrinkwrap.json and reaches OTel transitively via @sentry/node ^ ranges, so a pinned CLI install floats. Filed upstream https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1417. Transient for this PR: re-run CI once the tarballs are served."
files[1]{path,scope}:
  .github/workflows/ci.yml,project
close_reason: "Transient upstream cause: OpenTelemetry 2.12.0 tarballs were still propagating when CI installed the pinned CLI; all later runs installed it. Prevention is tracked upstream (unbraind/pm-cli#1417, shrinkwrap) and here (pm-rust-rnex, committed oracle lockfile)."
body: ""
